00:05:52.090 --> 00:05:54.150
And so what happens in
these four speed bumps?

00:05:54.150 --> 00:05:57.340
There's done tons of
rework within the cycle.

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:59.190
And so if you're a
smart team, you're

00:05:59.190 --> 00:06:00.840
going to prepare in
advance and you're

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:02.800
going to get all
your documents ready.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.850
But this process is
probably such a headache

00:06:05.850 --> 00:06:08.460
