00:06:08.460 --> 00:06:09.960
So rather than
getting one approved,

00:06:09.960 --> 00:06:11.580
I'm going to put 20 or 30.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:13.710
And so pretty soon
we're back to waterfall.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:15.930
The other thing is I know
