00:18:27.420 --> 00:18:29.690
And again, the sky's the limit.

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:35.180
If you're already using a CI/CD
orchestrator, such as Jenkins,

00:18:35.180 --> 00:18:37.460
that's something that
