00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.877
a pipeline for all
these artifacts

00:18:38.877 --> 00:18:40.960
that you're going to be
pushing into the platform.

00:18:40.960 --> 00:18:42.890
Thinking about source
control, each and every

00:18:42.890 --> 00:18:45.710
[? major ?] organization that
handles software development,

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:47.090
of course, they
might have chosen

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:51.073
a specific version or a specific
product for source control.

00:18:51.073 --> 00:18:52.490
So that's something
