00:28:20.150 --> 00:28:21.380
There's nothing here.

00:28:21.380 --> 00:28:22.100
You deploy.

00:28:22.100 --> 00:28:23.530
It'll automatically happen.

00:28:23.530 --> 00:28:24.530
RUBEN GONZALEZ: Exactly.

00:28:24.530 --> 00:28:26.447
Now the developer is
going to be able to focus

00:28:26.447 --> 00:28:30.260
on really defining a nice,
RESTful contract for the APIs.

00:28:30.260 --> 00:28:32.180
And now they're going
to be able to expose

00:28:32.180 --> 00:28:34.018
those APIs in a very nice way.

00:28:34.018 --> 00:28:35.810
And they don't have to
worry and to come up

00:28:35.810 --> 00:28:37.913
or to get too creative
with a security pattern.

00:28:37.913 --> 00:28:39.080
RAYMOND PENG: Yeah, perfect.

00:28:39.080 --> 00:28:41.630
And I see you also have
