that using a webhook.

00:32:17.270 --> 00:32:20.100
OK, so as you can
see, Ray, there's

00:32:20.100 --> 00:32:24.067
a lot of flexibility how
not only Ops teams, but also

00:32:24.067 --> 00:32:25.650
