are going to be

00:32:25.650 --> 00:32:27.570
able to monitor
specific patterns

00:32:27.570 --> 00:32:30.485
and react accordingly
in real time.

00:32:30.485 --> 00:32:32.910
RAYMOND PENG: Nice. so it's
a kind of a nice rules engine

00:32:32.910 --> 00:32:36.240
to find out issues and
to proactively notify.

00:32:36.240 --> 00:32:37.210
It's great.

00:32:37.210 --> 00:32:38.573
RUBEN GONZALEZ: Exactly.

