the security policies,

00:40:33.650 --> 00:40:36.650
you no longer have to make it an
obligation for every developer

00:40:36.650 --> 00:40:37.640
to do these things.

00:40:37.640 --> 00:40:39.080
Now you can centralize.

00:40:39.080 --> 00:40:41.240
That creates a
separation of concern.

00:40:41.240 --> 00:40:44.390
Let security in, let them
be part of the enforcement

00:40:44.390 --> 00:40:45.500
